  <div class="card cop-hero"><span>${esc(w.experience)} Protective Readiness operating environment</span><h2>Good morning, ${esc(w.user)}.</h2><p>${esc(readiness?.promise||"See risk early. Decide with confidence. Act in time. Prove the work was done.")}</p></div>
